<p id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">We used ABCI 3.0 provided by AIST and AIST Solutions with support from “ABCI 3.0 Development Acceleration Use”.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
